-- Proofs for hartogs.mm0.

injective_intro
---------------
l1: $ G , ⟨ x , z ⟩ ∈ F ⇒ ⟨ y , z ⟩ ∈ F → x = y $ by imp_intro [#1]
l2: $ G ⇒ ⟨ x , z ⟩ ∈ F → ⟨ y , z ⟩ ∈ F → x = y $ by imp_intro [l1]
l3: $ G , ⟨ x , z ⟩ ∈ F ∧ ⟨ y , z ⟩ ∈ F ⇒ ⟨ x , z ⟩ ∈ F ∧ ⟨ y , z ⟩ ∈ F $ by ax
l4: $ G , ⟨ x , z ⟩ ∈ F ∧ ⟨ y , z ⟩ ∈ F ⇒ ⟨ x , z ⟩ ∈ F $ by and_elim_l [l3]
l5: $ G , ⟨ x , z ⟩ ∈ F ∧ ⟨ y , z ⟩ ∈ F ⇒ ⟨ y , z ⟩ ∈ F $ by and_elim_r [l3]
l6: $ G , ⟨ x , z ⟩ ∈ F ∧ ⟨ y , z ⟩ ∈ F ⇒ ⟨ x , z ⟩ ∈ F → ⟨ y , z ⟩ ∈ F → x = y $ by weaken [l2]
l7: $ G , ⟨ x , z ⟩ ∈ F ∧ ⟨ y , z ⟩ ∈ F ⇒ ⟨ y , z ⟩ ∈ F → x = y $ by imp_elim [l6, l4]
l8: $ G , ⟨ x , z ⟩ ∈ F ∧ ⟨ y , z ⟩ ∈ F ⇒ x = y $ by imp_elim [l7, l5]
l9: $ G ⇒ ⟨ x , z ⟩ ∈ F ∧ ⟨ y , z ⟩ ∈ F → x = y $ by imp_intro [l8]
l10: $ G ⇒ ∀ z (⟨ x , z ⟩ ∈ F ∧ ⟨ y , z ⟩ ∈ F → x = y) $ by all_intro [l9]
l11: $ G ⇒ ∀ y ∀ z (⟨ x , z ⟩ ∈ F ∧ ⟨ y , z ⟩ ∈ F → x = y) $ by all_intro [l10]
l12: $ G ⇒ ∀ x ∀ y ∀ z (⟨ x , z ⟩ ∈ F ∧ ⟨ y , z ⟩ ∈ F → x = y) $ by all_intro [l11]

injective_elim
--------------
l1: $ G ⇒ ∀ y ∀ z (⟨ a , z ⟩ ∈ F ∧ ⟨ y , z ⟩ ∈ F → a = y) $ by all_elim [#1]
l2: $ G ⇒ ∀ z (⟨ a , z ⟩ ∈ F ∧ ⟨ b , z ⟩ ∈ F → a = b) $ by all_elim [l1]
l3: $ G ⇒ ⟨ a , c ⟩ ∈ F ∧ ⟨ b , c ⟩ ∈ F → a = b $ by all_elim [l2]
l4: $ G ⇒ ⟨ a , c ⟩ ∈ F ∧ ⟨ b , c ⟩ ∈ F $ by and_intro [#2, #3]
l5: $ G ⇒ a = b $ by imp_elim [l3, l4]

injective_subset
----------------
l1: $ G , ⟨ x , z ⟩ ∈ F , ⟨ y , z ⟩ ∈ F ⇒ ⟨ x , z ⟩ ∈ F $ by ax
l2: $ G , ⟨ x , z ⟩ ∈ F , ⟨ y , z ⟩ ∈ F ⇒ ⟨ y , z ⟩ ∈ F $ by ax
l3: $ G , ⟨ x , z ⟩ ∈ F , ⟨ y , z ⟩ ∈ F ⇒ F ⊆ H $ by weaken [#2]
l4: $ G , ⟨ x , z ⟩ ∈ F , ⟨ y , z ⟩ ∈ F ⇒ ⟨ x , z ⟩ ∈ H $ by wcel_subset [l3, l1]
l5: $ G , ⟨ x , z ⟩ ∈ F , ⟨ y , z ⟩ ∈ F ⇒ ⟨ y , z ⟩ ∈ H $ by wcel_subset [l3, l2]
l6: $ G , ⟨ x , z ⟩ ∈ F , ⟨ y , z ⟩ ∈ F ⇒ injective H $ by weaken [#1]
l7: $ G , ⟨ x , z ⟩ ∈ F , ⟨ y , z ⟩ ∈ F ⇒ x = y $ by injective_elim [l6, l4, l5]
l8: $ G ⇒ injective F $ by injective_intro [l7]

injective_cres
--------------
l1: $ G ⇒ cres F A ⊆ F $ by cres_subset
l2: $ G ⇒ injective (cres F A) $ by injective_subset [#1, l1]

injective_ccnv
--------------
l1: $ G , ⟨ x , y ⟩ ∈ ccnv F , ⟨ x , z ⟩ ∈ ccnv F ⇒ ⟨ x , y ⟩ ∈ ccnv F $ by ax
l2: $ G , ⟨ x , y ⟩ ∈ ccnv F , ⟨ x , z ⟩ ∈ ccnv F ⇒ ⟨ x , z ⟩ ∈ ccnv F $ by ax
l3: $ G , ⟨ x , y ⟩ ∈ ccnv F , ⟨ x , z ⟩ ∈ ccnv F ⇒ ⟨ y , x ⟩ ∈ F $ by ccnv_elim [l1]
l4: $ G , ⟨ x , y ⟩ ∈ ccnv F , ⟨ x , z ⟩ ∈ ccnv F ⇒ ⟨ z , x ⟩ ∈ F $ by ccnv_elim [l2]
l5: $ G , ⟨ x , y ⟩ ∈ ccnv F , ⟨ x , z ⟩ ∈ ccnv F ⇒ injective F $ by weaken [#1]
l6: $ G , ⟨ x , y ⟩ ∈ ccnv F , ⟨ x , z ⟩ ∈ ccnv F ⇒ y = z $ by injective_elim [l5, l3, l4]
l7: $ G ⇒ functional (ccnv F) $ by functional_intro [l6]

injective_congr
---------------
l0: $ ⟨ u , w ⟩ ≐ ⟨ u , w ⟩ $ by ceqt_refl
l1: $ (⟨ u , w ⟩ ∈ F) ⟺ (⟨ u , w ⟩ ∈ H) $ by wcel_congr [l0, #1]
l2: $ ⟨ v , w ⟩ ≐ ⟨ v , w ⟩ $ by ceqt_refl
l3: $ (⟨ v , w ⟩ ∈ F) ⟺ (⟨ v , w ⟩ ∈ H) $ by wcel_congr [l2, #1]
l4: $ (⟨ u , w ⟩ ∈ F ∧ ⟨ v , w ⟩ ∈ F) ⟺ (⟨ u , w ⟩ ∈ H ∧ ⟨ v , w ⟩ ∈ H) $ by and_congr [l1, l3]
l5: $ (u = v) ⟺ (u = v) $ by iff_refl
l6: $ (⟨ u , w ⟩ ∈ F ∧ ⟨ v , w ⟩ ∈ F → u = v) ⟺ (⟨ u , w ⟩ ∈ H ∧ ⟨ v , w ⟩ ∈ H → u = v) $ by im_congr [l4, l5]
l7: $ ∀ w (⟨ u , w ⟩ ∈ F ∧ ⟨ v , w ⟩ ∈ F → u = v) ⟺ ∀ w (⟨ u , w ⟩ ∈ H ∧ ⟨ v , w ⟩ ∈ H → u = v) $ by all_congr [l6]
l8: $ ∀ v ∀ w (⟨ u , w ⟩ ∈ F ∧ ⟨ v , w ⟩ ∈ F → u = v) ⟺ ∀ v ∀ w (⟨ u , w ⟩ ∈ H ∧ ⟨ v , w ⟩ ∈ H → u = v) $ by all_congr [l7]
l9: $ ∀ u ∀ v ∀ w (⟨ u , w ⟩ ∈ F ∧ ⟨ v , w ⟩ ∈ F → u = v) ⟺ ∀ u ∀ v ∀ w (⟨ u , w ⟩ ∈ H ∧ ⟨ v , w ⟩ ∈ H → u = v) $ by all_congr [l8]

