d28: $ G , ⟨ x , z ⟩ ∈ cres (ccom H F) A , ⟨ y , z ⟩ ∈ cres (ccom H F) A , ⟨ x , u ⟩ ∈ F , ⟨ u , z ⟩ ∈ H , ⟨ y , v ⟩ ∈ F , ⟨ v , z ⟩ ∈ H ⇒ x = y $ by injective_elim [d27, d25, d26]
e1: $ G , ⟨ x , z ⟩ ∈ cres (ccom H F) A , ⟨ y , z ⟩ ∈ cres (ccom H F) A , ⟨ x , u ⟩ ∈ F , ⟨ u , z ⟩ ∈ H ⇒ ⟨ y , z ⟩ ∈ ccom H F $ by weaken [c8]
e2: $ G , ⟨ x , z ⟩ ∈ cres (ccom H F) A , ⟨ y , z ⟩ ∈ cres (ccom H F) A , ⟨ x , u ⟩ ∈ F , ⟨ u , z ⟩ ∈ H ⇒ x = y $ by ccom_elim [e1, d28]
e3: $ G , ⟨ x , z ⟩ ∈ cres (ccom H F) A , ⟨ y , z ⟩ ∈ cres (ccom H F) A ⇒ x = y $ by ccom_elim [c6, e2]
e4: $ G ⇒ injective (cres (ccom H F) A) $ by injective_intro [e3]
e5: $ G ⇒ injects (ccom H F) A C $ by injects_intro [b13, e4]

injects_congr
-------------
l1: $ fn_into F A C ⟺ fn_into H B D $ by fn_into_congr [#1, #2, #3]
l2: $ cres F A ≐ cres H B $ by cres_congr [#1, #2]
l3: $ injective (cres F A) ⟺ injective (cres H B) $ by injective_congr [l2]
l4: $ (fn_into F A C ∧ injective (cres F A)) ⟺ (fn_into H B D ∧ injective (cres H B)) $ by and_congr [l1, l3]

