k13: $ G , injects f A B , injects g B C , i = cres (ccom g f) A ⇒ injects i A C $ by injects_eq [k9, k11, k12, k10]
k14: $ G , injects f A B , injects g B C , i = cres (ccom g f) A ⇒ inj_into A C $ by inj_into_intro [k13]
k15: $ G , injects f A B , injects g B C ⇒ inj_into A C $ by isset_elim [k7, k14]
