b8: $ G , g ∊ injs B D ⇒ B × D = A × C $ by cxp_eq [b5, b6]
b9: $ G , g ∊ injs B D ⇒ g ⊆ A × C $ by subset_eq_r [b8, b3]
b10: $ G , g ∊ injs B D ⇒ g ∊ injs A C $ by injs_intro [b7, b9]
