o3a: $ G , z ∊ reps a s , f ∊ injs a s , z = ⟨ img f a , erel f a ⟩ , u = img f a , v = erel f a ⇒ img f a ⊆ s $ by weaken [n3]
o3: $ G , z ∊ reps a s , f ∊ injs a s , z = ⟨ img f a , erel f a ⟩ , u = img f a , v = erel f a ⇒ u ⊆ s $ by subset_eq_l [o2, o3a]
o4: $ G , z ∊ reps a s , f ∊ injs a s , z = ⟨ img f a , erel f a ⟩ , u = img f a , v = erel f a ⇒ u ∊ 𝒫 s $ by cpw_intro [o3]
o5: $ G , z ∊ reps a s , f ∊ injs a s , z = ⟨ img f a , erel f a ⟩ , u = img f a , v = erel f a ⇒ v = erel f a $ by ax
o6: $ G , z ∊ reps a s , f ∊ injs a s , z = ⟨ img f a , erel f a ⟩ , u = img f a , v = erel f a ⇒ erel f a = v $ by eq_sym [o5]
o7a: $ G , z ∊ reps a s , f ∊ injs a s , z = ⟨ img f a , erel f a ⟩ , u = img f a , v = erel f a ⇒ erel f a ⊆ s × s $ by weaken [n4]
o7: $ G , z ∊ reps a s , f ∊ injs a s , z = ⟨ img f a , erel f a ⟩ , u = img f a , v = erel f a ⇒ v ⊆ s × s $ by subset_eq_l [o6, o7a]
o8: $ G , z ∊ reps a s , f ∊ injs a s , z = ⟨ img f a , erel f a ⟩ , u = img f a , v = erel f a ⇒ v ∊ 𝒫 (s × s) $ by cpw_intro [o7]
o9: $ G , z ∊ reps a s , f ∊ injs a s , z = ⟨ img f a , erel f a ⟩ , u = img f a , v = erel f a ⇒ ⟨ img f a , erel f a ⟩ = ⟨ u , v ⟩ $ by opair_eq [o2, o6]
o10a: $ G , z ∊ reps a s , f ∊ injs a s , z = ⟨ img f a , erel f a ⟩ , u = img f a , v = erel f a ⇒ z = ⟨ img f a , erel f a ⟩ $ by ax
o10: $ G , z ∊ reps a s , f ∊ injs a s , z = ⟨ img f a , erel f a ⟩ , u = img f a , v = erel f a ⇒ z = ⟨ u , v ⟩ $ by eq_trans [o10a, o9]
