p3: $ G , f ∊ injs a s , w = ⟨ img f a , erel f a ⟩ , g ∊ injs b s , w = ⟨ img g b , erel g b ⟩ ⇒ g ∊ injs b s $ by ax
p4: $ G , f ∊ injs a s , w = ⟨ img f a , erel f a ⟩ , g ∊ injs b s , w = ⟨ img g b , erel g b ⟩ ⇒ injects g b s $ by injs_elim [p3]
p5: $ G , f ∊ injs a s , w = ⟨ img f a , erel f a ⟩ , g ∊ injs b s , w = ⟨ img g b , erel g b ⟩ ⇒ w = ⟨ img f a , erel f a ⟩ $ by ax
p6: $ G , f ∊ injs a s , w = ⟨ img f a , erel f a ⟩ , g ∊ injs b s , w = ⟨ img g b , erel g b ⟩ ⇒ w = ⟨ img g b , erel g b ⟩ $ by ax
p5s: $ G , f ∊ injs a s , w = ⟨ img f a , erel f a ⟩ , g ∊ injs b s , w = ⟨ img g b , erel g b ⟩ ⇒ ⟨ img f a , erel f a ⟩ = w $ by eq_sym [p5]
p7: $ G , f ∊ injs a s , w = ⟨ img f a , erel f a ⟩ , g ∊ injs b s , w = ⟨ img g b , erel g b ⟩ ⇒ ⟨ img f a , erel f a ⟩ = ⟨ img g b , erel g b ⟩ $ by eq_trans [p5s, p6]
q0: $ G , f ∊ injs a s , w = ⟨ img f a , erel f a ⟩ , g ∊ injs b s , w = ⟨ img g b , erel g b ⟩ ⇒ isset s $ by isset_var
q1: $ G , f ∊ injs a s , w = ⟨ img f a , erel f a ⟩ , g ∊ injs b s , w = ⟨ img g b , erel g b ⟩ ⇒ isset (s × s) $ by cxp_set [q0, q0]
q2: $ G , f ∊ injs a s , w = ⟨ img f a , erel f a ⟩ , g ∊ injs b s , w = ⟨ img g b , erel g b ⟩ ⇒ img f a ⊆ s $ by injects_img [p2]
q3: $ G , f ∊ injs a s , w = ⟨ img f a , erel f a ⟩ , g ∊ injs b s , w = ⟨ img g b , erel g b ⟩ ⇒ isset (img f a) $ by subset_set [q2]
q4: $ G , f ∊ injs a s , w = ⟨ img f a , erel f a ⟩ , g ∊ injs b s , w = ⟨ img g b , erel g b ⟩ ⇒ erel f a ⊆ s × s $ by erel_subset [p2]
q5: $ G , f ∊ injs a s , w = ⟨ img f a , erel f a ⟩ , g ∊ injs b s , w = ⟨ img g b , erel g b ⟩ ⇒ isset (erel f a) $ by subset_isset [q1, q4]
q6: $ G , f ∊ injs a s , w = ⟨ img f a , erel f a ⟩ , g ∊ injs b s , w = ⟨ img g b , erel g b ⟩ ⇒ img g b ⊆ s $ by injects_img [p4]
q7: $ G , f ∊ injs a s , w = ⟨ img f a , erel f a ⟩ , g ∊ injs b s , w = ⟨ img g b , erel g b ⟩ ⇒ isset (img g b) $ by subset_set [q6]
q8: $ G , f ∊ injs a s , w = ⟨ img f a , erel f a ⟩ , g ∊ injs b s , w = ⟨ img g b , erel g b ⟩ ⇒ erel g b ⊆ s × s $ by erel_subset [p4]
q9: $ G , f ∊ injs a s , w = ⟨ img f a , erel f a ⟩ , g ∊ injs b s , w = ⟨ img g b , erel g b ⟩ ⇒ isset (erel g b) $ by subset_isset [q1, q8]
