p9: $ G , f ∊ injs a s , w = ⟨ img f a , erel f a ⟩ , g ∊ injs b s , w = ⟨ img g b , erel g b ⟩ ⇒ img f a = img g b $ by and_elim_l [p8]
p10: $ G , f ∊ injs a s , w = ⟨ img f a , erel f a ⟩ , g ∊ injs b s , w = ⟨ img g b , erel g b ⟩ ⇒ erel f a = erel g b $ by and_elim_r [p8]
p11: $ G , f ∊ injs a s , w = ⟨ img f a , erel f a ⟩ , g ∊ injs b s , w = ⟨ img g b , erel g b ⟩ ⇒ ord a $ by weaken [#1]
p12: $ G , f ∊ injs a s , w = ⟨ img f a , erel f a ⟩ , g ∊ injs b s , w = ⟨ img g b , erel g b ⟩ ⇒ ord b $ by weaken [#2]
p13: $ G , f ∊ injs a s , w = ⟨ img f a , erel f a ⟩ , g ∊ injs b s , w = ⟨ img g b , erel g b ⟩ ⇒ a = b $ by ord_rigid [p11, p12, p2, p4, p9, p10]
