l1: $ G , functional g ∧ ∀ x (x ∊ a → fv g x ∈ injs (fv f x) s) , functional j ∧ ∀ y (y ∊ ⋃ (img f a) → fv j y ∈ a ∧ y ∊ fv f (fv j y)) ⇒ functional g ∧ ∀ x (x ∊ a → fv g x ∈ injs (fv f x) s) $ by ax
l2: $ G , functional g ∧ ∀ x (x ∊ a → fv g x ∈ injs (fv f x) s) , functional j ∧ ∀ y (y ∊ ⋃ (img f a) → fv j y ∈ a ∧ y ∊ fv f (fv j y)) ⇒ functional j ∧ ∀ y (y ∊ ⋃ (img f a) → fv j y ∈ a ∧ y ∊ fv f (fv j y)) $ by ax
l3: $ G , functional g ∧ ∀ x (x ∊ a → fv g x ∈ injs (fv f x) s) , functional j ∧ ∀ y (y ∊ ⋃ (img f a) → fv j y ∈ a ∧ y ∊ fv f (fv j y)) ⇒ functional g $ by and_elim_l [l1]
l4: $ G , functional g ∧ ∀ x (x ∊ a → fv g x ∈ injs (fv f x) s) , functional j ∧ ∀ y (y ∊ ⋃ (img f a) → fv j y ∈ a ∧ y ∊ fv f (fv j y)) ⇒ ∀ x (x ∊ a → fv g x ∈ injs (fv f x) s) $ by and_elim_r [l1]
l5: $ G , functional g ∧ ∀ x (x ∊ a → fv g x ∈ injs (fv f x) s) , functional j ∧ ∀ y (y ∊ ⋃ (img f a) → fv j y ∈ a ∧ y ∊ fv f (fv j y)) ⇒ functional j $ by and_elim_l [l2]
l6: $ G , functional g ∧ ∀ x (x ∊ a → fv g x ∈ injs (fv f x) s) , functional j ∧ ∀ y (y ∊ ⋃ (img f a) → fv j y ∈ a ∧ y ∊ fv f (fv j y)) ⇒ ∀ y (y ∊ ⋃ (img f a) → fv j y ∈ a ∧ y ∊ fv f (fv j y)) $ by and_elim_r [l2]
l7: $ G , functional g ∧ ∀ x (x ∊ a → fv g x ∈ injs (fv f x) s) , functional j ∧ ∀ y (y ∊ ⋃ (img f a) → fv j y ∈ a ∧ y ∊ fv f (fv j y)) ⇒ functional (cgr k ⟨ fv j k , fv (fv g (fv j k)) k ⟩) $ by cgr_functional
l8: $ G , functional g ∧ ∀ x (x ∊ a → fv g x ∈ injs (fv f x) s) , functional j ∧ ∀ y (y ∊ ⋃ (img f a) → fv j y ∈ a ∧ y ∊ fv f (fv j y)) ⇒ functional (cres (cgr k ⟨ fv j k , fv (fv g (fv j k)) k ⟩) (⋃ (img f a))) $ by functional_cres [l7]
l10: $ G , functional g ∧ ∀ x (x ∊ a → fv g x ∈ injs (fv f x) s) , functional j ∧ ∀ y (y ∊ ⋃ (img f a) → fv j y ∈ a ∧ y ∊ fv f (fv j y)) , z ∊ ⋃ (img f a) ⇒ z ∊ ⋃ (img f a) $ by ax
l11: $ G , functional g ∧ ∀ x (x ∊ a → fv g x ∈ injs (fv f x) s) , functional j ∧ ∀ y (y ∊ ⋃ (img f a) → fv j y ∈ a ∧ y ∊ fv f (fv j y)) , z ∊ ⋃ (img f a) ⇒ functional g $ by weaken [l3]
l12: $ G , functional g ∧ ∀ x (x ∊ a → fv g x ∈ injs (fv f x) s) , functional j ∧ ∀ y (y ∊ ⋃ (img f a) → fv j y ∈ a ∧ y ∊ fv f (fv j y)) , z ∊ ⋃ (img f a) ⇒ functional j $ by weaken [l5]
l13: $ G , functional g ∧ ∀ x (x ∊ a → fv g x ∈ injs (fv f x) s) , functional j ∧ ∀ y (y ∊ ⋃ (img f a) → fv j y ∈ a ∧ y ∊ fv f (fv j y)) , z ∊ ⋃ (img f a) ⇒ ∀ x (x ∊ a → fv g x ∈ injs (fv f x) s) $ by weaken [l4]
l14: $ G , functional g ∧ ∀ x (x ∊ a → fv g x ∈ injs (fv f x) s) , functional j ∧ ∀ y (y ∊ ⋃ (img f a) → fv j y ∈ a ∧ y ∊ fv f (fv j y)) , z ∊ ⋃ (img f a) ⇒ ∀ y (y ∊ ⋃ (img f a) → fv j y ∈ a ∧ y ∊ fv f (fv j y)) $ by weaken [l6]
l15: $ G , functional g ∧ ∀ x (x ∊ a → fv g x ∈ injs (fv f x) s) , functional j ∧ ∀ y (y ∊ ⋃ (img f a) → fv j y ∈ a ∧ y ∊ fv f (fv j y)) , z ∊ ⋃ (img f a) ⇒ fv j z ∈ a ∧ z ∊ fv f (fv j z) ∧ injects (fv g (fv j z)) (fv f (fv j z)) s $ by h3_pick (z := $ z $) [l11, l12, l13, l14, l10]
l16: $ G , functional g ∧ ∀ x (x ∊ a → fv g x ∈ injs (fv f x) s) , functional j ∧ ∀ y (y ∊ ⋃ (img f a) → fv j y ∈ a ∧ y ∊ fv f (fv j y)) , z ∊ ⋃ (img f a) ⇒ fv j z ∈ a $ by and_elim_l [l15]
l17: $ G , functional g ∧ ∀ x (x ∊ a → fv g x ∈ injs (fv f x) s) , functional j ∧ ∀ y (y ∊ ⋃ (img f a) → fv j y ∈ a ∧ y ∊ fv f (fv j y)) , z ∊ ⋃ (img f a) ⇒ z ∊ fv f (fv j z) ∧ injects (fv g (fv j z)) (fv f (fv j z)) s $ by and_elim_r [l15]
l18: $ G , functional g ∧ ∀ x (x ∊ a → fv g x ∈ injs (fv f x) s) , functional j ∧ ∀ y (y ∊ ⋃ (img f a) → fv j y ∈ a ∧ y ∊ fv f (fv j y)) , z ∊ ⋃ (img f a) ⇒ z ∊ fv f (fv j z) $ by and_elim_l [l17]
l19: $ G , functional g ∧ ∀ x (x ∊ a → fv g x ∈ injs (fv f x) s) , functional j ∧ ∀ y (y ∊ ⋃ (img f a) → fv j y ∈ a ∧ y ∊ fv f (fv j y)) , z ∊ ⋃ (img f a) ⇒ injects (fv g (fv j z)) (fv f (fv j z)) s $ by and_elim_r [l17]
l20: $ G , functional g ∧ ∀ x (x ∊ a → fv g x ∈ injs (fv f x) s) , functional j ∧ ∀ y (y ∊ ⋃ (img f a) → fv j y ∈ a ∧ y ∊ fv f (fv j y)) , z ∊ ⋃ (img f a) ⇒ fv (fv g (fv j z)) z ∈ s $ by injects_fv [l19, l18]
l21: $ G , functional g ∧ ∀ x (x ∊ a → fv g x ∈ injs (fv f x) s) , functional j ∧ ∀ y (y ∊ ⋃ (img f a) → fv j y ∈ a ∧ y ∊ fv f (fv j y)) , z ∊ ⋃ (img f a) ⇒ ⟨ fv j z , fv (fv g (fv j z)) z ⟩ ∈ a × s $ by cxp_intro_c [l16, l20]
l22: $ G , functional g ∧ ∀ x (x ∊ a → fv g x ∈ injs (fv f x) s) , functional j ∧ ∀ y (y ∊ ⋃ (img f a) → fv j y ∈ a ∧ y ∊ fv f (fv j y)) , z ∊ ⋃ (img f a) ⇒ isset ⟨ fv j z , fv (fv g (fv j z)) z ⟩ $ by wcel_isset [l21]
l23: $ G , functional g ∧ ∀ x (x ∊ a → fv g x ∈ injs (fv f x) s) , functional j ∧ ∀ y (y ∊ ⋃ (img f a) → fv j y ∈ a ∧ y ∊ fv f (fv j y)) , z ∊ ⋃ (img f a) , v = ⟨ fv j z , fv (fv g (fv j z)) z ⟩ ⇒ v = ⟨ fv j z , fv (fv g (fv j z)) z ⟩ $ by ax
l24: $ G , functional g ∧ ∀ x (x ∊ a → fv g x ∈ injs (fv f x) s) , functional j ∧ ∀ y (y ∊ ⋃ (img f a) → fv j y ∈ a ∧ y ∊ fv f (fv j y)) , z ∊ ⋃ (img f a) , v = ⟨ fv j z , fv (fv g (fv j z)) z ⟩ ⇒ ⟨ z , v ⟩ ∈ cgr k ⟨ fv j k , fv (fv g (fv j k)) k ⟩ $ by cgr_intro (x := $ k $, B := $ ⟨ fv j k , fv (fv g (fv j k)) k ⟩ $) [l23]
