l25: $ G , ⟨ x , y ⟩ ∈ shift a , ⟨ x , z ⟩ ∈ shift a , i ∊ a ∧ u ⊆ a × ω ∧ x = ⟨ i , u ⟩ ∧ y = csn ⟨ i , ∅ ⟩ ∪ shiftp u , j ∊ a ∧ k ⊆ a × ω ∧ x = ⟨ j , k ⟩ ∧ z = csn ⟨ j , ∅ ⟩ ∪ shiftp k ⇒ j ∊ a $ by and_elim_l [l20]
l26: $ G , ⟨ x , y ⟩ ∈ shift a , ⟨ x , z ⟩ ∈ shift a , i ∊ a ∧ u ⊆ a × ω ∧ x = ⟨ i , u ⟩ ∧ y = csn ⟨ i , ∅ ⟩ ∪ shiftp u , j ∊ a ∧ k ⊆ a × ω ∧ x = ⟨ j , k ⟩ ∧ z = csn ⟨ j , ∅ ⟩ ∪ shiftp k ⇒ k ⊆ a × ω $ by and_elim_l [l21]
l30: $ G , ⟨ x , y ⟩ ∈ shift a , ⟨ x , z ⟩ ∈ shift a , i ∊ a ∧ u ⊆ a × ω ∧ x = ⟨ i , u ⟩ ∧ y = csn ⟨ i , ∅ ⟩ ∪ shiftp u , j ∊ a ∧ k ⊆ a × ω ∧ x = ⟨ j , k ⟩ ∧ z = csn ⟨ j , ∅ ⟩ ∪ shiftp k ⇒ ⟨ i , u ⟩ = x $ by eq_sym [l13]
l31: $ G , ⟨ x , y ⟩ ∈ shift a , ⟨ x , z ⟩ ∈ shift a , i ∊ a ∧ u ⊆ a × ω ∧ x = ⟨ i , u ⟩ ∧ y = csn ⟨ i , ∅ ⟩ ∪ shiftp u , j ∊ a ∧ k ⊆ a × ω ∧ x = ⟨ j , k ⟩ ∧ z = csn ⟨ j , ∅ ⟩ ∪ shiftp k ⇒ ⟨ i , u ⟩ = ⟨ j , k ⟩ $ by eq_trans [l30, l23]
l32: $ G , ⟨ x , y ⟩ ∈ shift a , ⟨ x , z ⟩ ∈ shift a , i ∊ a ∧ u ⊆ a × ω ∧ x = ⟨ i , u ⟩ ∧ y = csn ⟨ i , ∅ ⟩ ∪ shiftp u , j ∊ a ∧ k ⊆ a × ω ∧ x = ⟨ j , k ⟩ ∧ z = csn ⟨ j , ∅ ⟩ ∪ shiftp k ⇒ i = j $ by opair_inj_l [l31]
