l36: $ G , ⟨ x , y ⟩ ∈ shift a , ⟨ x , z ⟩ ∈ shift a , i ∊ a ∧ u ⊆ a × ω ∧ x = ⟨ i , u ⟩ ∧ y = csn ⟨ i , ∅ ⟩ ∪ shiftp u , j ∊ a ∧ k ⊆ a × ω ∧ x = ⟨ j , k ⟩ ∧ z = csn ⟨ j , ∅ ⟩ ∪ shiftp k ⇒ csn ⟨ j , ∅ ⟩ ∪ shiftp k = z $ by eq_sym [l24]
