l119: $ G , ⟨ x , z ⟩ ∈ cres (shift a) (a × 𝒫 (a × ω)) , ⟨ y , z ⟩ ∈ cres (shift a) (a × 𝒫 (a × ω)) , i ∊ a ∧ u ⊆ a × ω ∧ x = ⟨ i , u ⟩ ∧ z = csn ⟨ i , ∅ ⟩ ∪ shiftp u , j ∊ a ∧ k ⊆ a × ω ∧ y = ⟨ j , k ⟩ ∧ z = csn ⟨ j , ∅ ⟩ ∪ shiftp k ⇒ x = ⟨ j , k ⟩ $ by eq_trans [l93, l118]
l120: $ G , ⟨ x , z ⟩ ∈ cres (shift a) (a × 𝒫 (a × ω)) , ⟨ y , z ⟩ ∈ cres (shift a) (a × 𝒫 (a × ω)) , i ∊ a ∧ u ⊆ a × ω ∧ x = ⟨ i , u ⟩ ∧ z = csn ⟨ i , ∅ ⟩ ∪ shiftp u , j ∊ a ∧ k ⊆ a × ω ∧ y = ⟨ j , k ⟩ ∧ z = csn ⟨ j , ∅ ⟩ ∪ shiftp k ⇒ ⟨ j , k ⟩ = y $ by eq_sym [l103]
