l123: $ G , ⟨ x , z ⟩ ∈ cres (shift a) (a × 𝒫 (a × ω)) , ⟨ y , z ⟩ ∈ cres (shift a) (a × 𝒫 (a × ω)) , i ∊ a ∧ u ⊆ a × ω ∧ x = ⟨ i , u ⟩ ∧ z = csn ⟨ i , ∅ ⟩ ∪ shiftp u , ∃ k (j ∊ a ∧ k ⊆ a × ω ∧ y = ⟨ j , k ⟩ ∧ z = csn ⟨ j , ∅ ⟩ ∪ shiftp k) ⇒ x = y $ by ex_elim [l122, l121]
